<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Nice to meet you (feat. Central Cee)</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="group" xml:id="v1">PinkPantheress, Central Cee</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Nice to meet you (feat. Central Cee)</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">4Ovbv1o91fNP8tYLJmboX1</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:10.674" end="00:12.845">And this beat from Cash, not from YouTube</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:12.845" end="00:14.345" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:13.606" end="00:16.034">I pray that I'll die before my baby</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.034" end="00:19.058">I'll take a risk if anyone tries to touch my baby</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.058" end="00:25.113">That's my love, love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.113" end="00:26.613" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.803" end="00:29.047">I have secrets, and yes, I know you know too many</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.047" end="00:31.983">I'll stay at your house where I'll hope that you'll protect me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.983" end="00:37.960">You're my love, love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.960" end="00:39.460" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.451" end="00:41.282">It's your honey, nice to meet you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.282" end="00:45.075">My love's pouring like a waterfall</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.075" end="00:48.366">That's why I don't mind all your dollar signs</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.366" end="00:51.293">You're keeping me up each and every night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.293" end="00:54.539">Now I've never, felt quite like this</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.539" end="00:58.244">It's your motor, it's the way you kiss (That's my)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.244" end="01:01.289">Tell them how we met because you tell it best</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.289" end="01:04.411">You're the thing that connects my brain to my chest, because</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.411" end="01:05.911" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.406" end="01:07.777">I pray that I'll die before my baby</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.777" end="01:10.801">I'll take a risk if anyone tries to touch my baby</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.801" end="01:16.814">That's my mmm-ooh, my baby</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.814" end="01:18.314" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.606" end="01:20.765">I have secrets, and yes, I know you know too many</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.765" end="01:23.813">I'll stay at your house where I'll hope that you'll protect me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.813" end="01:29.459">You're my love, love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.459" end="01:30.959" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.266" end="01:33.337">It's your honey, nice to meet you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.337" end="01:36.608">My love's pouring like a waterfall</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.608" end="01:39.737">I've never, felt quite like this</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.737" end="01:42.652">It's your motor, it's the way you kiss</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.652" end="01:44.174" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.174" end="01:45.800">I woke up to my shorty crying</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.800" end="01:49.060">I said, "Nah, I'm not being unfaithful, baby," and somehow she caught me lying</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.060" end="01:51.961">I try say it weren't me, it was one of my G's, you can call the guys</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.961" end="01:53.605">But it weren't one time, it was four or five</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.605" end="01:55.161">Long story short, we don't talk no more</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.161" end="01:57.069">Now she on Tiktok doing story time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.069" end="01:58.817">I might risk it for a biscuit</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.817" end="02:01.942">Put my hand in her jar and try reach for a cookie, sweet and I can't resist it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.942" end="02:05.214">I'm innocent until proven guilty, my girl not convinced, but I'm not convicted</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.214" end="02:08.335">I feel like a creep when I call restricted, pissed 'cause she blocked my digits</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.335" end="02:09.881">Leave it to god, I can't stop what's written</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.881" end="02:11.618">I crossed the world you still cross my mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.618" end="02:13.118">I'm a trap boy and she like goody utes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.941" end="02:14.955">If I remember correctly I'm not her type</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.955" end="02:18.109">Cupid try aim at my heart, I jumped over the car, try duck and dive</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.109" end="02:22.344">Now she putting up pics of rapper relationships like it must be nice</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:22.344" end="02:24.430" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.430" end="02:26.295">Love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:26.295" end="02:30.189">I'll, I'll die before my baby (Yeah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:30.189" end="02:33.629">Try to touch my baby, that's my love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:33.629" end="02:37.629">I'll die before my—</p></div></body></tt>